          "type": "text",
          "plain_text": "The unglamorous option is often the right one. Every print here can be ordered unframed, or with a wood, black or white frame for £25, chosen on the product page before it goes in the basket. It turns up ready to hang, which is worth something when the alternative is a Saturday at the framers with a cardboard tube under your arm.",
          "href": null,
          "text": {
            "content": "The unglamorous option is often the right one. Every print here can be ordered unframed, or with a wood, black or white frame for £25, chosen on the product page before it goes in the basket. It turns up ready to hang, which is worth something when the alternative is a Saturday at the framers with a cardboard tube under your arm.",
